# Line-ending law: this is a Bun/LF repo. Checkouts are byte-deterministic on every OS; git never
# rewrites endings behind our back (a CRLF smudge on a fresh worktree broke the NovelAI escrow
# byte-for-byte fixture test - escrow fidelity depends on exact bytes).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Escrow/round-trip fixtures are sacred bytes: no conversion of any kind, ever.
src/formats/**/fixtures/** -text
samples/** -text
fixtures/** -text

# Binary assets.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.charx binary
*.byaf binary
*.woff2 binary
